sequenceDiagram
 actor Customer
 participant UI as React UI
 participant API as Spring Boot API
 participant Svc as OrderService
 participant DB as MySQL
 Customer->>UI: Confirm checkout
 UI->>API: POST /api/v1/orders + JWT
 API->>Svc: Validate and create order
 Svc->>DB: Read cart and trusted prices
 Svc->>DB: Persist order and items
 DB-->>Svc: Commit / order ID
 Svc-->>API: Response DTO
 API-->>UI: 201 Created
 UI-->>Customer: Confirmation
